---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import {
  qwen36Mq4r,
  qwen38Mq4v2,
  FRESHNESS_NOTE,
  HETEROGENEOUS_NOTE,
} from "../../data/performance";

const description =
  "Distilled deck on RDNA silicon — wave32, WMMA, packed DOT, and dispatch from gfx1010 to gfx1201. Performance figures are fixture-scoped beta snapshots, not cross-silicon speedup claims.";
---

<Base title="RDNA & WMMA — A Distil" description={description}>
  <article class="distil">
    <div class="distil-meta">
      <a href="/learn">/learn</a> &middot; deck 01 &middot; RDNA / WMMA
    </div>
    <h1 class="distil-title">RDNA &amp; WMMA &mdash; A Distil</h1>
    <p class="distil-lede">
      Companion to <a href="/learn/cdna-mfma">AMD Distil &mdash; CDNA / MFMA</a>.
      This deck zooms in on the <em>other</em> AMD compute family: RDNA
      (consumer / pro / APU), the <strong>WMMA</strong> matrix path that
      arrived with RDNA3, and historical performance findings retained by the
      <a href="https://github.com/warpfront/hipfire/tree/beta">hipfire</a>
      project across real RDNA silicon (gfx1010 / gfx1030 / gfx1100 /
      gfx1151 / gfx12xx).
    </p>
    <p class="distil-lede">
      Where the CDNA deck spends its budget on data-center matrix throughput
      (MFMA, HBM, XCDs), this deck spends its budget on the consumer-silicon
      realities: <strong>wave32, GDDR6 / system-RAM, 16&times;16&times;16 matrix tiles
      via WMMA, and a dispatch story that has to span five generations from
      RDNA1 (no matrix unit at all) up to RDNA4 (gfx12 WMMA layout with half8
      packing on the same 16&times;16&times;16 tile)</strong>.
    </p>

    <hr class="distil-rule" />

    <!-- ============================================================ 1 -->
    <section class="distil-section">
      <h2><span class="num">01</span> The RDNA family at a glance</h2>
      <p>
        <code>hipfire</code> targets the entire RDNA family with one Rust
        binary &mdash; the matrix-path feature gating is the load-bearing
        piece of the dispatch layer.
      </p>

      <div class="distil-fig" data-widget="gen-timeline" aria-label="Matrix path across RDNA generations">
